# unknown-api-service.tflw — CHECK-ONLY FIXTURE (M49, PLAN_WEBV2_M45.md): a typo'd named `api`
# service — demonstrates `tflw check`'s teaching diagnostic (TF026: checker, an `api <service>`
# name not declared in the active env, "did you mean `root`?"). `root` is a real named service
# declared under `env local` (`tflw.config`).
#
# Run explicitly (dot-directory, invalid syntax — see bad-keyword.tflw's header for why):
#   npx tflw check tests/.checkonly/unknown-api-service.tflw

test "a typo'd named api service"
  api roott GET /health
